---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TopNav from "../TopNav.astro";
import Footer from "../Footer.astro";
import { resolveLocale, t } from "../../i18n";

const RELEASES_URL = "https://github.com/HarlonWang/TrendingAI/releases/latest";
const SIDELOADLY_URL = "https://sideloadly.io/";
const ALTSTORE_URL = "https://altstore.io/";

const locale = resolveLocale(Astro.currentLocale);
---

<BaseLayout
    title={t(locale, "iosInstall.title")}
    description={t(locale, "iosInstall.description")}
    canonicalPath="/app/ios/"
>
    <TopNav activeRoute="app" />
    <main class="pt-20 pb-16 px-4">
        <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
            {locale === "zh" ? (
                <>
                    <h1>iOS 安装指南</h1>

                    <p>
                        TrendingAI 的 iOS 版暂未上架 App Store，当前需要用「侧载」（Sideload）方式安装。
                        本文介绍两种方案：<strong>AltStore</strong>（推荐）和 <strong>Sideloadly</strong>。
                    </p>
                    <p class="notice">
                        iOS 版目前处于早期阶段，功能仍在完善中，遇到问题欢迎
                        <a href="https://github.com/HarlonWang/TrendingAI/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">提交反馈</a>。
                    </p>

                    <h2>开始前须知</h2>
                    <p>两种方案都借助 Apple 提供的免费开发者签名，存在以下限制：</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>签名 7 天有效</strong>，到期后 App 无法打开，需重新续签（应用数据不会丢失；两种工具都支持同一 Wi-Fi 下自动续签）</li>
                        <li>单个 Apple ID 最多同时安装 <strong>3 个</strong>侧载应用</li>
                        <li>首次安装需要一台 macOS 或 Windows 电脑</li>
                        <li>iOS 16 及以上需开启「开发者模式」（见下文）</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>准备工作</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>一台 macOS 或 Windows 电脑、iPhone / iPad、一根稳定的数据线（首次安装，以及手机走蜂窝流量安装时需要）</li>
                        <li>一个 Apple ID——用于给安装包签名，<strong>不要求与手机上登录的账号相同</strong>，可以用小号；侧载数量、签名有效期等限制都算在这个账号头上</li>
                        <li>安装包：前往 <a href={RELEASES_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Releases</a> 下载最新版本的 <code>TrendingAI-x.y.z.ipa</code> 附件</li>
                        <li>Windows 用户须安装<strong>官网版 iTunes</strong>（Microsoft Store 版不行，需卸载后从 Apple 官网重装）</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>方法一：AltStore（推荐）</h2>
                    <h3>电脑端准备（macOS）</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li>从 <a href={ALTSTORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">altstore.io</a> 下载 AltServer，解压后把 AltServer.app 拖入「应用程序」并启动（图标在菜单栏）</li>
                        <li>数据线连接 iPhone 并信任，访达侧边栏选中设备 → 勾选「在 Wi-Fi 下显示此 iPhone」</li>
                    </ol>
                    <h3>电脑端准备（Windows）</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li>安装<strong>官网版 iTunes 与 iCloud</strong>（均不能用 Microsoft Store 版）</li>
                        <li>从 <a href={ALTSTORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">altstore.io</a> 下载 AltServer，解压运行 Setup.exe，之后以管理员身份运行（图标在系统托盘）</li>
                        <li>数据线连接 iPhone 并信任，iTunes 设备摘要页 → 勾选「通过 Wi-Fi 与此 iPhone 同步」</li>
                    </ol>
                    <h3>安装</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li>点击电脑上的 AltServer 图标 → <strong>Install AltStore</strong> → 选择设备，输入 Apple ID 与密码，等手机桌面出现 AltStore 图标（没出现可重启设备）</li>
                        <li>iOS 16 及以上先开启「开发者模式」（见下文）</li>
                        <li>把 IPA 文件传到手机（AirDrop 或文件 App），打开 AltStore → <strong>My Apps</strong> → 左上角 “+” 选择 IPA 安装；也可以在电脑上按住 Option（Windows：Shift）点击 AltServer 图标 → <strong>Sideload .ipa…</strong> 直接选文件推送安装</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p>
                        提示：安装过程中手机若在用蜂窝流量，AltStore 会提示找不到 AltServer——用数据线连着电脑操作即可，AltServer 同时支持 Wi-Fi 和 USB 两种通道。
                    </p>

                    <h2>方法二：Sideloadly</h2>
                    <p class="notice">
                        iOS 26 及以上目前存在兼容问题：安装会报 <code>Invalid file</code> 错误，社区多有同款反馈且官方长期未修。
                        iOS 26+ 用户请使用方法一 AltStore。
                    </p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>从 <a href={SIDELOADLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">sideloadly.io</a> 下载并安装 Sideloadly</li>
                        <li>打开 Sideloadly，在 Apple ID 栏输入你的账号邮箱</li>
                        <li>用数据线连接设备，手机上弹出「要信任此电脑吗？」时点信任；连接成功后设备名会出现在 iDevice 栏</li>
                        <li>点击左侧 IPA 图标，选择下载好的 IPA 文件，点 <strong>Start</strong></li>
                        <li>首次使用需输入 Apple ID 密码；开启双重认证的账号在弹窗中输入 6 位验证码</li>
                        <li>进度条显示 <strong>Done.</strong> 即安装成功</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p>
                        提示：Start 左侧的「刷新」图标保持开启（默认开启），设备与电脑在同一 Wi-Fi 时会每 7 天自动续签。
                    </p>

                    <h2>iOS 16+：开启开发者模式</h2>
                    <p>
                        设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 拉到底部找到「开发者模式」→ 开启，按提示重启设备并确认。
                    </p>

                    <h2>常见问题</h2>
                    <h3>登录或安装时报 “The data couldn't be read because it isn't in the correct format”</h3>
                    <p>
                        这是设备当前网络访问不了 Apple 的签名服务（<code>gsa.apple.com</code>）导致的，国内部分宽带 / 运营商网络下常见。
                        两个解法：① 手机切换到蜂窝流量重试（最简单；AltStore 每次安装 app 都要连这个服务，安装全程保持蜂窝）；
                        ② 有代理工具的话，把 <code>gsa.apple.com</code>（或整个 <code>apple.com</code> 后缀）加入代理规则——
                        这个域名通常不在常见分流名单里，这正是「开着代理也失败」的原因。
                    </p>
                    <h3>首次打开提示「不受信任的开发者」</h3>
                    <p>
                        设置 → 通用 → VPN 与设备管理（旧系统显示为「描述文件与设备管理」）→
                        在「开发者 APP」下点签名用的 Apple ID → 信任并确认，之后即可正常打开。
                    </p>
                    <h3>自动续签需要什么条件？</h3>
                    <p>
                        三个条件缺一不可：电脑开机且工具在运行（Sideloadly 的后台服务 / AltServer 常驻）；
                        手机与电脑在<strong>同一 Wi-Fi</strong>（数据线只有首次安装需要）；
                        AltStore 用户还需开启过 Wi-Fi 同步。
                        不需要时刻保持连接——7 天窗口内任意时刻回到同一网络续上一次即可。
                        长期外出错过窗口也只是 App 暂时打不开，重新续签即可，数据不丢。
                    </p>
                    <h3>7 天后 App 打不开了</h3>
                    <p>
                        签名过期了。用安装时的工具重新执行一次安装（续签）即可，应用数据不会丢失；
                        满足上一条的自动续签条件可以避免手动操作。
                    </p>
                    <h3>不想依赖电脑续签</h3>
                    <p>
                        可以了解 <strong>SideStore</strong>（AltStore 的社区分支，支持免电脑续签），
                        安装步骤更复杂，适合进阶用户。
                    </p>
                </>
            ) : (
                <>
                    <h1>Install on iOS</h1>

                    <p>
                        The TrendingAI iOS app is not on the App Store yet. For now, it is installed by
                        <strong> sideloading</strong>. This guide covers two options:
                        <strong> AltStore</strong> (recommended) and <strong>Sideloadly</strong>.
                    </p>
                    <p class="notice">
                        The iOS app is at an early stage and still evolving. If you hit problems, please
                        <a href="https://github.com/HarlonWang/TrendingAI/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener"> open an issue</a>.
                    </p>

                    <h2>Before you start</h2>
                    <p>Both options rely on Apple's free developer signing, which comes with limits:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Signatures expire after 7 days</strong> — the app stops opening until re-signed (your data is kept; both tools can auto-refresh over the same Wi-Fi)</li>
                        <li>At most <strong>3 sideloaded apps</strong> per Apple ID at a time</li>
                        <li>A macOS or Windows computer is required for the first install</li>
                        <li>iOS 16 and later require Developer Mode (see below)</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>What you need</h2>
                    <ul>
                        <li>A macOS or Windows computer, an iPhone / iPad, and a reliable cable (needed for the first install, and whenever installing while the phone is on cellular data)</li>
                        <li>An Apple ID — used only to sign the app. It <strong>does not need to match the account signed in on your phone</strong>; a secondary account works fine. The sideload limits (app count, signature expiry) are tied to this account</li>
                        <li>The app: download the latest <code>TrendingAI-x.y.z.ipa</code> asset from <a href={RELEASES_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Releases</a></li>
                        <li>Windows users must install <strong>iTunes from Apple's website</strong> (the Microsoft Store version does not work — uninstall it and reinstall from apple.com)</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>Option 1: AltStore (recommended)</h2>
                    <h3>Computer setup (macOS)</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Download AltServer from <a href={ALTSTORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">altstore.io</a>, unzip, drag AltServer.app into Applications and launch it (the icon lives in the menu bar)</li>
                        <li>Connect and trust your iPhone, select it in the Finder sidebar → check "Show this iPhone when on Wi-Fi"</li>
                    </ol>
                    <h3>Computer setup (Windows)</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Install <strong>iTunes and iCloud from Apple's website</strong> (neither may be the Microsoft Store version)</li>
                        <li>Download AltServer from <a href={ALTSTORE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">altstore.io</a>, unzip, run Setup.exe, then run it as administrator (the icon lives in the system tray)</li>
                        <li>Connect and trust your iPhone, then check "Sync with this iPhone over Wi-Fi" in the iTunes device summary</li>
                    </ol>
                    <h3>Install</h3>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Click the AltServer icon on your computer → <strong>Install AltStore</strong> → choose your device and enter your Apple ID and password; wait for the AltStore icon to appear on the phone (restart the device if it doesn't)</li>
                        <li>On iOS 16+, enable Developer Mode first (see below)</li>
                        <li>Send the IPA to your phone (AirDrop or the Files app), open AltStore → <strong>My Apps</strong> → tap “+” and pick the IPA; alternatively, hold Option (Windows: Shift) and click the AltServer icon → <strong>Sideload .ipa…</strong> to push the file directly</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p>
                        Tip: if the phone is on cellular data during install, AltStore will report it cannot find
                        AltServer — just keep the device connected to the computer with a cable; AltServer works
                        over both Wi-Fi and USB.
                    </p>

                    <h2>Option 2: Sideloadly</h2>
                    <p class="notice">
                        Known compatibility issue on iOS 26 and later: installs fail with an
                        <code> Invalid file</code> error, widely reported and unfixed upstream for months.
                        On iOS 26+, use Option 1 (AltStore) instead.
                    </p>
                    <ol>
                        <li>Download and install Sideloadly from <a href={SIDELOADLY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">sideloadly.io</a></li>
                        <li>Open Sideloadly and enter your Apple ID email</li>
                        <li>Connect your device with a cable and tap "Trust This Computer" on the phone; your device appears in the iDevice field</li>
                        <li>Click the IPA icon, pick the downloaded IPA file, then click <strong>Start</strong></li>
                        <li>Enter your Apple ID password on first use; with two-factor auth, enter the 6-digit code in the prompt</li>
                        <li>When the progress bar shows <strong>Done.</strong>, the app is installed</li>
                    </ol>
                    <p>
                        Tip: keep the refresh icon next to Start enabled (it is by default) — the signature
                        auto-refreshes every 7 days while the device and computer share the same Wi-Fi.
                    </p>

                    <h2>iOS 16+: enable Developer Mode</h2>
                    <p>
                        Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → scroll to the bottom → Developer Mode → turn it on,
                        then restart and confirm when prompted.
                    </p>

                    <h2>FAQ</h2>
                    <h3>"The data couldn't be read because it isn't in the correct format" when logging in or installing</h3>
                    <p>
                        Your device's current network cannot reach Apple's signing service
                        (<code>gsa.apple.com</code>) — common on some ISPs. Two fixes: switch the phone to
                        cellular data and retry (simplest; AltStore contacts this service on every install, so
                        stay on cellular throughout), or if you use a proxy tool, route
                        <code> gsa.apple.com</code> (or the whole <code>apple.com</code> suffix) through it —
                        this domain is usually missing from common rule lists, which is why the error can appear
                        even with a proxy enabled.
                    </p>
                    <h3>"Untrusted Developer" on first launch</h3>
                    <p>
                        Settings → General → VPN &amp; Device Management (or "Profiles &amp; Device Management"
                        on older versions) → under Developer App, tap the Apple ID used for signing → Trust.
                    </p>
                    <h3>What does auto-refresh require?</h3>
                    <p>
                        Three things, all at once: the computer is on with the tool running (Sideloadly's
                        background service / AltServer in the tray); the phone and computer are on the
                        <strong> same Wi-Fi</strong> (the cable is only needed for the first install); and for
                        AltStore, Wi-Fi sync enabled. You don't need to stay connected all the time — refreshing
                        once at any point within the 7-day window is enough. If you miss the window while away,
                        the app just stops opening until you re-sign; your data is kept.
                    </p>
                    <h3>The app stopped opening after 7 days</h3>
                    <p>
                        The signature expired. Re-run the install (re-sign) with the same tool — your data is
                        kept. Meeting the auto-refresh conditions above avoids the manual step.
                    </p>
                    <h3>Refreshing without a computer</h3>
                    <p>
                        Look into <strong>SideStore</strong> (a community fork of AltStore that refreshes without
                        a computer). Setup is more involved and best suited to advanced users.
                    </p>
                </>
            )}
        </article>
    </main>
    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .prose {
        color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
        line-height: 1.75;
    }
    .prose h1 {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--color-on-surface);
    }
    .prose h1:first-child {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .prose h2 {
        font-size: 1.375rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        color: var(--color-on-surface);
    }
    .prose h3 {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--color-on-surface);
    }
    .prose p {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .prose ul,
    .prose ol {
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .prose ul {
        list-style-type: disc;
    }
    .prose ol {
        list-style-type: decimal;
    }
    .prose li {
        margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .prose strong {
        color: var(--color-on-surface);
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .prose a {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
    .prose code {
        font-size: 0.875em;
        background: var(--color-surface-container);
        border-radius: 0.25rem;
        padding: 0.125rem 0.375rem;
    }
    .prose .notice {
        border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary);
        background: var(--color-surface-container);
        border-radius: 0.5rem;
        padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    }
</style>
